# Judge11-6-6

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:false
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL5,ArmR4,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:そんなことをしても、人間は苦しまないんじゃないかな。|#0206Trial06_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL11,ArmR12,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:当時の人は誰も生きていないんだから<br>覚えてなんてないよ。|#0206Trial06_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL5,ArmR4,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Thinking_Closed01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:なのに君が人間を滅ぼしたとしても、<br>誰も後悔なんてしないし、<br>誰も罪の意識に苦しんだりなんてしない……。|#0206Trial06_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmL11,ArmR12,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Scream_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:キミがやっていることは、無意味な自己満足だよ！|#0206Trial06_Ema026| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:だとして、それがどうかしましたか？|#0206Trial06_Yuki030| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:人間たちは何も思わないかもしれません。|#0206Trial06_Yuki031| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:【気がつけば滅亡していた】だけかもしれませんね。|#0206Trial06_Yuki032| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:それでも私の目的は達成します。|#0206Trial06_Yuki033| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:この世界から全ての人類を抹殺すること……。|#0206Trial06_Yuki034| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:それで死んでいった魔女たちも喜ぶでしょう。|#0206Trial06_Yuki035| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:そして魔女を滅ぼした当時の愚かな人間たちも、<br>地獄で絶望と怨嗟の声を上げているかもしれない。|#0206Trial06_Yuki036| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.12
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:それこそが、<br>全てを失った私に唯一残された<br>【希望】なのです……。|#0206Trial06_Yuki037| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

